        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"AHI-London\"> </a><b>AHI LONDON, Explore Hardware Knurled London Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black London Knurled Lever is a sleek, textured leverset that is sure to add visual appeal to all your doors. It is very easy to install with only a screwdriver and will fit almost all pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Explore Hardware Knurled London Lever has a deep, matte black finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Matte Black London Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Knurled Leverset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.96\" (126mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter: 0.87\" (22.2mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.47\" (62.9mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.36\" (59.9mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 0.39\" (10mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-London-specifications.pdf?v=1691093348\"><b>AHI London Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door lever on one side of the door. Visible surface mounting screws. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li></li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Visible surface mounting screws on interior and exterior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Privacy pin on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"456\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#AHI-London\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-London.jpg?v=1704354580\" width=\"152\" height=\"141\" alt=\"AHI-London\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/st-tropez-knurled-leverset-with-round-rose\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-ST-TOPEZ.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"152\" height=\"141\" alt=\"AHI-St-Tropez\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-knurled-lever-with-round-rose\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-Montreal.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"152\" height=\"141\" alt=\"AHI-Montreal\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#AHI-London\"><b>Matte Black</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/st-tropez-knurled-leverset-with-round-rose\"><b>Satin Brass</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-knurled-lever-with-round-rose\"><b>Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
